Backport the three store-release changes from LIU Zhiwei's posted ARM patch.
https://www.mail-archive.com/qemu-devel%40nongnu.org/msg1218202.html
Message-ID: 20260821064032.49556-3-zhiwei_liu@linux.alibaba.com

Only older translator names/context and comment wording differ. No load-side
change or other patch from the series is included. This is an experimental
backport, not a claim of upstream acceptance.

